{"body": "The purpose of this change is to enable future partition spec changes\nand to assign IDs to specs that can be easily encoded in an Avro file\nthat tracks a snapshot's manifests.\nThis updates TableMetadata and the metadata parser to support multiple\npartition specs. This change is forward-compatible for older readers\nbecause the \"partition-spec\" field in table metadata is still set to the\ndefault spec.\nMultiple specs are now stored in an array in table metadata called\n\"partition-specs\". Each entry in the array is an object with two fields,\na \"spec-id\" field with an integer ID value, and \"fields\" with a partition\nspec value (an array of partition fields). This also adds\n\"default-spec-id\" that points to the spec that should be used when\nwriting.", "date": "2018-11-25T22:13:44Z", "hash": "sha256:398ab865af64f9b28253", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#3", "meta": {"additions": 422, "base": "master", "closed_at": "2018-12-05T19:53:06Z", "comments": 3, "deletions": 101, "draft": false, "files": ["api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/PartitionSpec.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/ManifestReader.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/ManifestWriter.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/PartitionSpecParser.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/TableMetadata.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/TableMetadataParser.java", "core/src/test/java/com/netflix/iceberg/TestMergeAppend.java", "core/src/test/java/com/netflix/iceberg/TestTableMetadataJson.java"], "merged_at": "2018-12-05T19:53:06Z", "merged_by": "rdblue", "n_files": 8, "number": 3, "repo": "apache/iceberg", "reviews": [{"at": "2018-11-26T01:02:45Z", "by": "rdsr", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2018-11-26T17:03:00Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}], "state": "merged", "thumbs_up": 0, "updated_at": "2018-12-05T19:53:06Z"}, "people": ["rdblue"], "refs": [], "source": "github", "title": "Store multiple partition specs in table metadata.", "type": 